# Dev Container

Load [devcontainer-hardened](.agents/skills/devcontainer-hardened/SKILL.md) for full workflow.

## Non-negotiables

- **Minimal** config — small blast radius; no kitchen-sink image or Docker-in-Docker by default.
- **Official** `node:<major>-bookworm-slim@sha256:…` — resolve LTS major via `scripts/resolve-node-lts-major.mjs` in that skill.
- **`postCreateCommand`:** `pnpm install --frozen-lockfile` (one line).
- **Cursor:** `anysphere.remote-containers` — not `ms-vscode-remote.remote-containers`.
- Pin digest deliberately; document Node major in `.devcontainer/README.md`.
